---
permalink: /map/
title: "Map of American Watch Brands & Watchmakers | American Watchmaking Directory"
description: "An interactive map of watch brands, independent watchmakers and suppliers across the United States and Canada. Find watch businesses near you."
navActive: "map"
---
{% extends "base.njk" %}
{% import "macros.njk" as m with context %}
{%- set unplaced = collections.brands | unplaced -%}

{% block head %}{{ m.mapAssets() }}{% endblock %}

{% block main %}
        <div class="page-intro">
            <h1>Map</h1>
            <p>Where America's watch brands, watchmakers and suppliers are based. Click a cluster to zoom in, or a pin for details. Alaska, Hawaii and Puerto Rico are a short pan away. You can also <a href="/states/">browse by state</a>.</p>
        </div>

        {%- set placed = collections.brands | placed %}
        <div class="chip-row map-filter" role="group" aria-label="Company type" data-map="map-full">
            <button type="button" class="fchip" data-value="" aria-pressed="true">All <span class="n">{{ placed.length }}</span></button>
            {%- for f in placed | facet("products") %}
            <button type="button" class="fchip" data-value="{{ f.value }}" aria-pressed="false">{{ f.value }} <span class="n">{{ f.count }}</span></button>
            {%- endfor %}
        </div>
        {{ m.map(collections.brands, "map-full", "full", "", "north-america") }}
        <p class="map-note"><span id="map-count" aria-live="polite">{{ placed.length }} of {{ collections.brands.length }} listings are on the map.</span> Hollow pins are placed at the state level because we only know the state. United States and Canada are counted separately.</p>

        {% if unplaced.length %}
        <section class="section">
            <div class="section-head">
                <h2>Not on the map yet ({{ unplaced.length }})</h2>
                <a href="/suggest/">Know where they're based? Tell us &rarr;</a>
            </div>
            <div class="chip-list">
                {% for b in unplaced %}<a class="chip-link" href="{{ b.url }}">{{ b.data.name }} <span class="n">{{ b.data.country }}</span></a>{% endfor %}
            </div>
        </section>
        {% endif %}
{% endblock %}

{% block scripts %}{{ m.mapScripts() }}{% endblock %}
